<title>BELGIUM: Coceral changes 1997 EU winter barley.</title>
<headline>Coceral changes 1997 EU winter barley.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coceral, the EU grain trade lobby, corrected upwards on Friday its estimate of the EU 1997 winter barley area to 5.42 million hectares from 4.78 million.</p>
<p>It also amended the total EU winter grain area to 24.77 million ha from 24.12 million.</p>
<p>The correction followed an upward revision in the German winter barley area to 1.15 million ha from 827,000 ha.</p>
<p>The 1996 German winter barley area was also revised upwards to 1.14 million ha, from 795,000 ha.</p>
</text>
